  "description": "NetMetric.GC is a high-performance module for collecting .NET runtime GC metrics:\n\t\t\tallocation rate (bytes/s), heap size and change rate, GC pause time (%, ms),\n\t\t\tbucket histograms with tumbling windows, summaries (p50/p90/p99),\n\t\t\tgeneration (Gen0/1/2) counts, and runtime flags (Server GC, LOH compaction, latency mode).\n\t\t\tUses System.Runtime EventCounters and GC APIs; ships collectors, options, and a lightweight listener.",
